~ start
set voice_pitch = 0.25
if not mayor_encountered
	=> first_encounter

if not trash_disposed_of
	Mayor: If you'll excuse me I have to practice my speech.
	Mayor: "We must say di[wave]NO[/wave] to tyranny..."
	=> END
	
if not has_autograph
	Mayor: Well butter my tail and call me a biscuit, you've done it!
	Mayor: Take this signed photograph of me as a sign of gratitude.
	Mayor: I was lookin' rather dashing that day if I do say so myself.
	set has_autograph = true
	set mayor_quest_complete = true
	do reveal_item("ThadPhoto")
	=> END

Mayor: I hope to see you at the polls! 
Mayor: Remember, a vote for me is a vote for whatever political issue you individually care about the most!

=> END



~ first_encounter
if not player_clothed
	Mayor: Why hello there my... nude friend.
else
	Mayor: Why hello there my good fellow!
	
Mayor: I don't believe I've had the pleasure of your acquaintance.
Mayor: I am Mayor Thaddeus Brontoborough III, pleased to meet.
Mayor: I must say, I am in a bit of conundrum at this particular junction in time.
Mayor: In an act of service to the community I've taken it upon myself to clean up the garbage proliferatin' throughout this fine street.
Mayor: However, I musta pulled somethin' this mornin' because my neck is in dire straights.
Mayor: Do you think you could gather up these here garbage sacks and take em' over to the dumpster for me?
Mayor: With the election coming up so soon I need to stay in good shape if I want to beat that no-good, philanderin' [wave]Hats Beakman[/wave].
set mayor_encountered = true
=> END

